    },
    {
      "id": "vDIpAdsW0WkvEhSQ4ffr_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 1155,
      "width": 460.9072265625,
      "height": 247.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b04",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 839466918,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1244327610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793338706823,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " First connection, A to B\n 1. A signs in to Clerk and holds T1.\n 2. plxd A asks the relay for the account's hosts (T1): B's hostId.\n 3. A tries B's LAN routes; 200 ms later, /connect with T1 too.\n 4. The relay joins A to B's spare stream to its :7341.\n 5. TLS 1.3 inside: B's key thumbprint must equal hostId.\n 6. A gets a fresh T2 and posts it with a DPoP proof to\n    /api/auth/account. The relay never sees T2.\n 7. B checks T2 against Clerk's JWKS and sub == its account.\n 8. A's key is new, so both show a code: Enter on B (plx\n    connect), Confirm on A. B issues a session for later.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "steps",
      "originalText": " First connection, A to B\n 1. A signs in to Clerk and holds T1.\n 2. plxd A asks the relay for the account's hosts (T1): B's hostId.\n 3. A tries B's LAN routes; 200 ms later, /connect with T1 too.\n 4. The relay joins A to B's spare stream to its :7341.\n 5. TLS 1.3 inside: B's key thumbprint must equal hostId.\n 6. A gets a fresh T2 and posts it with a DPoP proof to\n    /api/auth/account. The relay never sees T2.\n 7. B checks T2 against Clerk's JWKS and sub == its account.\n 8. A's key is new, so both show a code: Enter on B (plx\n    connect), Confirm on A. B issues a session for later.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DNJIMXwN_vzs_aHkXf3Mx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1095,
      "y": 1155,
      "width": 433.4150390625,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b05",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1263426278,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1967911398,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793338706823,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Trust (Ryan's call 1)\n The relay can't: read or change a stream (pinned TLS),\n set B's account, or mint a session.\n A compromised relay can list a fake host and catch a\n token. The token alone gets nothing: an unknown key waits\n until the user approves it once, matching a 6-digit code.\n Still trusted: a brand-new device's first host, as in T3.\n Other choices: sign-in alone (T3), or a pairing code\n per client and host (0065).",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "trust",
      "originalText": " Trust (Ryan's call 1)\n The relay can't: read or change a stream (pinned TLS),\n set B's account, or mint a session.\n A compromised relay can list a fake host and catch a\n token. The token alone gets nothing: an unknown key waits\n until the user approves it once, matching a 6-digit code.\n Still trusted: a brand-new device's first host, as in T3.\n Other choices: sign-in alone (T3), or a pairing code\n per client and host (0065).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "s73mhvyifp5OYceeDbLKX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 1460,
      "width": 395.6396484375,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 198053414,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1259407226,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793338706823,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Removed one release after Work 3 and 5 ship\n - Tailscale listener :7340 and tailscale whois\n - connect setting, connect/devices, plxd connect on|off\n - tailnet: routes on the desktop and the phone\n - ssh to a Tailscale IP for installs and sign-ins",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "removed",
      "originalText": " Removed one release after Work 3 and 5 ship\n - Tailscale listener :7340 and tailscale whois\n - connect setting, connect/devices, plxd connect on|off\n - tailnet: routes on the desktop and the phone\n - ssh to a Tailscale IP for installs and sign-ins",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
